        {
          "id": "4.1",
          "type": "open",
          "q": "Find the derivative of tan x from first principles.",
          "answer": "f'(x) = lim h→0 [tan(x + h) − tan x]/h = lim [sin(x + h)cos x − cos(x + h)sin x]/[h cos(x + h) cos x]\n= lim sin h/[h cos(x + h) cos x] = 1 × 1/cos²x = sec²x.",
